flowchart TD
    A["Agent-Team invoked"] --> B{"Status request?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["Read counts and freshness; leave work running"]
    B -->|No| D["Start one ready task or recover unfinished teams"]
    D --> E["Verify ownership; work in feature worktree"]
    E --> F{"Feature checks pass?"}
    F -->|No| G["Repair or report blocker"]
    G -->|Repair| E
    F -->|Yes| H{"with-preview required?"}
    H -->|No| L["Submit exact branch revision for integration"]
    H -->|Yes| I["Submit a stable preview version"]
    I --> J{"User approved this version?"}
    J -->|No| K["Hold integration; address feedback"]
    K -->|New review version| I
    J -->|Yes| L
